#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_webcams/visionportal-webcams.rst:39
msgid ""
"The Logitech C270 is Logitech's budget line of webcams. It is incredibly "
"inexpensive, and fairly reliable. The C270 is the workhorse webcam for "
"*FIRST* Tech Challenge."
msgstr ""
"Logitech C270は、Logitechの低価格帯のウェブカメラです。非常に安価で、かなり信頼性があります。C270は、 *FIRST* Tech"
" Challengeの作業用ウェブカメラです。"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_webcams/visionportal-webcams.rst:42
msgid ""
"The Logitech C270 has a 60-degree field of view, and a maximum frame rate of"
" 30fps at 720p which makes it a reasonable choice for vision processing."
msgstr ""
"Logitech C270は、60度の視野角を持ち、720pで最大30fpsのフレームレートを実現しているため、ビジョン処理に適した選択肢となります。"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_webcams/visionportal-webcams.rst:44
msgid ""
"The audio quality of the C270 is lackluster, but audio is not generally a "
"factor in *FIRST* Tech Challenge."
msgstr "C270の音質は平凡ですが、音声は一般的に *FIRST* Tech Challengeでは重要な要素ではありません。"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_webcams/visionportal-webcams.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Supported Resolutions:** 160x120, 176x144, 320x176, 320x240, 352x288, "
"432x240, 544x288, 640x360, 640x480, 752x416, 800x448, 800x600, 864x480, "
"960x544, 960x720, 1024x576, 1184x656, 1280x720"
